{
  "tickets": [
    {
      "id": "gen-051",
      "subject": "Question about handling pharmacy alerts for out-of-stock items",
      "body": "Hello support team, I hope you are having a good week. I am writing to ask about the best way to handle notifications from local pharmacies when a prescribed medication is currently out of stock. Earlier today, I tried looking in the prescription module for a quick way to switch an active script to an alternative therapeutic agent, but I couldn't find the right menu option. Could you please walk me through the correct messaging workflow to update the pharmacy with the replacement drug? Thank you so much for your help.",
      "body_length": 526
    },
    {
      "id": "gen-052",
      "subject": "Confused about patient portal account unlocking and password help",
      "body": "Hi there, I am really struggling to understand how we are supposed to help patients who get locked out of their online portal accounts. Yesterday and today, several people called the front desk because they forgot their passwords or couldn't get their dependent profiles to link properly. I tried going into the user administration settings to unlock them, but the buttons were grayed out or I just kept going in circles. Could someone please explain step-by-step how we are supposed to manage these password resets and account unlocks on our end?",
      "body_length": 537
    },
    {
      "id": "gen-053",
      "subject": "Inquiry regarding compliance archives and backup configurations",
      "body": "Please provide the necessary documentation and instructions for configuring our automated data backup schedules and establishing compliance archive settings under our current tier.",
      "body_length": 178
    },
    {
      "id": "gen-054",
      "subject": "Denied claims reporting and appeal attachments",
      "body": "I need help with denied claims. Several recent submissions were rejected by the payer and I cannot figure out how to attach the supporting clinical notes to the appeal form. I tried opening the billing ledger, clicking the denied line item, and looking under attachments, but the upload button is missing. Also, please point me to the reporting tool so I can track denial trends for last month. Need this resolved ASAP.",
      "body_length": 427
    },
    {
      "id": "gen-055",
      "subject": "Sorry to bother, automated text reminders not going out",
      "body": "Hi, sorry to bother you, but our patients are reporting that they aren't receiving their automated SMS reminders before their visits. Could you please take a quick look at our reminder settings when you have a moment?",
      "body_length": 218
    },
    {
      "id": "gen-056",
      "subject": "URGENT: Pharmacy out-of-stock alert blocking patient prescription change",
      "body": "I am so sorry to rush you, but I have patients waiting in exam rooms right now and a pharmacy just sent an urgent out-of-stock notice for a vital medication. I cannot figure out how to quickly switch the script to an alternative agent in the system. Please help me fix this straight away so I can finish my visits.",
      "body_length": 343
    },
    {
      "id": "gen-057",
      "subject": "Sorry to bother - quick question on posting remittances",
      "body": "Hi there, I am sorry to bother you with such a small thing, but could someone point me to the right screen for posting electronic remittance advices? We just want to make sure we are logging everything correctly.",
      "body_length": 213
    },
    {
      "id": "gen-058",
      "subject": "CONCERN: Patient saw wrong pharmacy/location data in directory",
      "body": "I am extremely frustrated right now because it looks like a patient might have seen another person's pharmacy preferences or location notes due to some strange glitch in the directory search. When we tried updating a local pharmacy entry that recently closed, the screen refreshed and displayed a different patient's saved profile details for a few seconds. This is a huge privacy worry for our clinic, and I need to know immediately how this happened and how to prevent it from ever occurring again.",
      "body_length": 542
    },
    {
      "id": "gen-059",
      "subject": "Question regarding online appointment booking restrictions for specific visit types",
      "body": "Hello, I am writing to ask for some guidance on setting up our online patient portal booking options. We recently enabled web booking so patients can schedule their routine check-ups directly, but we noticed that specialty consults and certain urgent follow-up visits are also showing up as available online. I tried navigating through the scheduling template configuration menus to restrict online booking to specific provider types and visit categories, but I couldn't find where those filters live. Could you please provide some detailed steps on how to properly configure these online scheduling restrictions? Thank you so much for your assistance.",
      "body_length": 651
    },
    {
      "id": "gen-060",
      "subject": "Frustrated with medication out-of-stock alert workflow",
      "body": "Hi team, I am getting really frustrated trying to figure out these out-of-stock medication notices. Every time a pharmacy flags a drug, the system just loops me back to the main chart instead of letting me swap the prescription smoothly. Can someone please explain what I am missing here?",
      "body_length": 298
    }
  ]
}
